Origin
------

Relaxify is the React Native successor to Fix-Spotify
(https://github.com/AshirwadRai/Fix-Spotify), an Android music player built on
a WebView. The search, source-matching, streaming and download engine that
Relaxify embeds under android/app/src/main/python/ is derived from Fix-Spotify's
backend, which is also licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.
Portions Copyright (C) Ashirwad Rai and the Fix-Spotify contributors.


